# Functional-identifier allowlist. Approved by Frank Asante Van Laarhoven,
# 2026-09-04, for this repository only.
#
# WHAT THIS PERMITS, AND ONLY THIS: the vendor name that the Claude Code tool
# requires in its own configuration paths, environment variable and file
# headers. `.claude/`, `CLAUDE.md`, `CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR` and the
# `@.claude/governance-router.md` import line are identifiers the tool reads.
# Rename any of them and the governance gate silently stops running. They are
# API surface, in the same sense as an endpoint or a model id -- not a byline.
#
# WHAT IT DOES NOT PERMIT, anywhere, including in these paths: AI authorship,
# attribution, contributor credit, Co-authored-by trailers, "generated by",
# "written by", or vendor branding in research prose, the README, the paper or
# any public-facing description. The guard's anchored structural pass still
# runs on every path listed here, so listing a file widens what it may NAME and
# never what it may CLAIM. Frank remains the sole author.
#
# Paths are exact rather than globbed on purpose. `.claude/*` would admit every
# future file dropped into that directory without anyone deciding to; each of
# these was reviewed for why the identifier cannot be spelled some other way.
#
# Not listed, and deliberately untracked: .claude/settings.local.json
# (per-developer permissions, absolute home paths) and
# .claude/execution-preflight.md (rewritten by the SessionStart hook every
# session). See .gitignore.

CLAUDE.md
.gitignore
.attribution-allow
.claude/governance-router.md
.claude/settings.json
.claude/hooks/preflight_gate.py
.claude/hooks/session_preflight.py
.claude/research-governance.enabled
